  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/66b0cfe5b3a72af561b899a1616a06f2ea115261158dc72c4f1a885de86306a6.png] \n\nOption 1) ̶ , +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\n75 - 26 + 45 × 3 = __**6 ÷ 4**__ + 10\n\n75 - 26 + __**45 **____**× 3**__ = 1.5 + 10\n\n__**75**__ - 26 __**+ 13**5__ = __**1.5 + 10\n\n210 - 26**__ = 11.5\n\n184 ≠ 11.5\n\nOption 2) ̶ , ̶ , ÷, =, ×, +\n\n75 - 26 - __**45 ÷ 3**__ = 6 × 4 + 10\n\n75 - 26 - 15 = __**6 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 10\n\n75 - 26 - 15 = __24** + 10\n\n75 - 26 - 15**__ = 34\n\n34 = 34 \n\nOption 3) +, ̶ , ÷, ×, =, +\n\n75 + 26 - __**45 ÷ 3**__ × 6 = 4 + 10\n\n75 + 26 - __15** ×**____** 6**__ = 4 + 10\n\n__**75 +**____** 26**__ - 90 = __**4 + 10**\n\n101____** - 90**__ = 14\n\n11 ≠ 14\n\nOption 4) ̶ , +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\n75 - 26 + __**45 ÷ 3**__ × 6 = 4 + 10\n\n75 - 26 + __15** ×**____** 6**__ = 4 + 10\n\n__**75**__ - 26 __**+ 90**__ =__** 4 + 10\n\n165 - 26**__ = 14\n\n139 ≠ 14\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 2)**\n\n39:",
